---
description: Guardrails for the eventual Supabase-backed event administration layer.
globs: ["**/supabase/**", "**/features/events/**", "**/app/**/admin/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Treat Supabase as infrastructure, not as the domain model.
- Use Row Level Security for persistent data.
- Keep admin-only operations server-side.
- Never expose service-role secrets to the browser.
- Validate input at the application boundary and again where persistence requires it.
- Keep migrations version-controlled.
- Do not add database coupling to presentational components.
